  $\deg(\mu)$ is the square-free part of the integer
  ```

  New:

  ```
  $\deg(\mu)$ is the square-free part of the positive rational number
  ```

  Old:

  ```
  $\operatorname{nrd}(\mu)/\operatorname{discrd}(O)$.
  ```

  New:

  ```
  $\operatorname{nrd}(\mu)/\operatorname{discrd}(O)$, that is, the square-free positive integer $d$ such that $\operatorname{nrd}(\mu)/(d\operatorname{discrd}(O))$ is the square of a rational number.
  ```

